�</span></div>\n      <div class=\"marquee-item\"><span class=\"marquee-lang\">Odia</span><span class=\"marquee-phrase\">ପ୍ରତ୍ୟେକ ଶିଶୁ ନିଜ ମାତୃଭାଷାରେ ସର୍ବୋତ୍ତମ ଶିଖେ</span><span class=\"marquee-sep\">✦</span></div>\n      <div class=\"marquee-item\"><span class=\"marquee-lang\">Tamil</span><span class=\"marquee-phrase\">ஒவ்வொரு குழந்தையும் தாய்மொழியில் மிகச் சிறப்பாகக் கற்கிறது</span><span class=\"marquee-sep\">✦</span></div>\n      <div class=\"marquee-item\"><span class=\"marquee-lang\">Telugu</span><span class=\"marquee-phrase\">ప్రతి బిడ్డ తన మాతృభాషలో ఉత్తమంగా నేర్చుకుంటాడు</span><span class=\"marquee-sep\">✦</span></div>\n      <!-- Duplicate set for seamless continuous marquee loop -->\n      <div class=\"marquee-item\"><span class=\"marquee-lang\">Hindi</span><span class=\"marquee-phrase\">हर बच्चा अपनी मातृभाषा में सबसे बेहतर सीखता है</span><span class=\"marquee-sep\">✦</span></div>\n      <div class=\"marquee-item\"><span class=\"marquee-lang\">Santhali / ᱚᱞ ᱪᱤᱠᱤ</span><span class=\"marquee-phrase\">ᱡᱚᱛᱚ ᱜᱤᱫᱽᱨᱟᱹ ᱟᱯᱱᱟᱨ ᱟᱭᱳ ᱟᱲᱟᱝ ᱛᱮ ᱯᱟᱲᱦᱟᱣᱜ-ᱟ</span><span class=\"marquee-sep\">✦</span></div>\n      <div class=\"marquee-item\"><span class=\"marquee-lang\">Mundari</span><span class=\"marquee-phrase\">सोबेन गड़ाको अपना एंगा जगर ते सेचेद ओमोःआ</span><span class=\"marquee-sep\">✦</span></div>\n      <div class=\"marquee-item\"><span class=\"marquee-lang\">Ho / ᱣᱟᱨᱟᱝ ᱪᱤᱛᱤ</span><span class=\"marquee-phrase\">ᱥᱳᱵᱮᱱ ᱜᱤᱫᱤᱨᱠᱳ ᱟᱯᱱᱟ ᱮᱝᱜᱟ ᱡᱟᱜᱟᱨ ᱛᱮ ᱥᱮᱪᱮᱫ ᱱᱟᱢᱮᱭᱟ</span><span class=\"marquee-sep\">✦</span></div>\n      <div class=\"marquee-item\"><span class=\"marquee-lang\">Kurukh / कुड़ुख़</span><span class=\"marquee-phrase\">हुर्मी कुक्कुरु तंगहै एंगो कत्था ती बेस से पड़हओर</span><span class=\"marquee-sep\">✦</span></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n'@ | Out-File -FilePath \"index.html\" -Encoding utf8","Cwd":"C:\\Users\\Lenovo\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\bhashasetu-ai","IsDaemon":false,"WaitMsBeforeAsync":3000,"toolAction":"Write Part 1 of index.html","toolSummary":"Write Na