{"step_index":59,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-15T17:57:49Z","thinking":"Focus is now on crafting Part 2 of `index.html`. This includes the problem section, solution section, and the interactive demo. Each section must be carefully constructed to clearly present the core features and functionality. The interactive demo requires detailed consideration of its various elements and how they'll work together to provide a valuable user experience.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"@'\n\n  <!-- =========================================================================\n       Problem Statement Section\n       ========================================================================= -->\n  <section id=\"problem\" class=\"problem-section\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"text-center\">\n        <span class=\"section-tag\" data-i18n=\"prob_tag\">The Challenge</span>\n        <h2 class=\"section-title\" data-i18n=\"prob_title\">The Silent Classroom Crisis in Rural India</h2>\n        <p class=\"section-subtitle\" data-i18n=\"prob_subtitle\">\n          When a teacher speaks only Hindi and the child speaks only Santhali or Ho, learning stops before it even begins.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"narrative-box\">\n        <div class=\"narrative-title\">\n          <span>⚠️</span>\n          <span data-i18n=\"prob_story_title\">The Ground Reality in West Singhbhum & Dumka</span>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"narrative-text\" data-i18n=\"prob_story_text\">\n          Freshly appointed primary teachers in Jharkhand's tribal heartlands often arrive without speaking the local mother tongue of their students. In Grade 1 classrooms, children listen to unfamiliar state curricula in silence, unable to comprehend foundational phonics or basic numeracy. NEP 2020 mandates primary education in the mother tongue, but severe teacher shortages and language mismatches leave millions behind.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"stats-grid-4\">\n        <div class=\"stat-card saffron\">\n          <div class=\"stat-card-number\" data-i18n=\"prob_card1_num\">38.4%</div>\n          <div class=\"stat-card-label\" data-i18n=\"prob_card1_label\">Foundational Literacy Gap</div>\n          <p class=\"stat-card-desc\" data-i18n=\"prob_card1_desc\">\n            Between native tribal-speaking students and state-language medium students by Grade 3.\n          </p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"stat-card\">\n          <div class=\"stat-card-number\" data-i18n=\"prob_card2_num\">8+</div>\n          <div class=\"stat-card-label\" data-i18n=\"prob_card2_label\">Indigenous Languages</div>\n          <p class=\"stat-card-desc\" data-i18n=\"prob_card2_desc\">\n            In Jharkhand without mainstream digitized digital primary school curriculum.\n          </p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"stat-card\">\n          <div class=\"stat-card-number\" data-i18n=\"prob_card3_num\">74%</div>\n          <div class=\"stat-card-label\" data-i18n=\"prob_card3_label\">Teacher Communication Barrier</div>\n          <p class=\"stat-card-desc\" data-i18n=\"prob_card3_desc\">\n            Primary rural teachers report language disconnect as their single biggest classroom impediment.\n          </p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"stat-card green\">\n          <div class=\"stat-card-number\" data-i18n=\"prob_card4_num\">12,000+</div>\n          <div class=\"stat-card-label\" data-i18n=\"prob_card4_label\">Zero-Connectivity Schools</div>\n          <p class=\"stat-card-desc\" data-i18n=\"prob_card4_desc\">\n            Classrooms in deep forest blocks with zero cellular signal requiring 100% offline Edge AI.\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- =========================================================================\n       Solution Section\n       ========================================================================= -->\n  <section id=\"solution\" class=\"solution-section\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"text-center\">\n        <span class=\"section-tag green\" data-i18n=\"sol_tag\">The Innovation</span>\n        <h2 class=\"section-title\" data-i18n=\"sol_title\">Empowering Rural Teachers With Edge AI Pedagogy</h2>\n        <p class=\"section-subtitle\" data-i18n=\"sol_subtitle\">\n          An inclusive, lightweight, offline-first pedagogical assistant designed for low-resource classroom hardware.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"solution-grid\">\n        <div class=\"solution-card\">\n          <div class=\"solution-icon-box\">🗣️</div>\n          <div class=\"solution-card-body\">\n            <h3 data-i18n=\"sol_card1_title\">Real-Time Classroom Translation</h3>\n            <p data-i18n=\"sol_card1_desc\">\n              Bidirectional speech-to-speech and speech-to-text. Teachers speak natural Hindi or English; students hear clear native audio in their mother tongue.\n            </p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"solution-card\">\n          <div class=\"solution-icon-box\">⚡</div>\n          <div class=\"solution-card-body\">\n            <h3 data-i18n=\"sol_card2_title\">100% Offline Edge-First AI</h3>\n            <p data-i18n=\"sol_card2_desc\">\n              Runs completely offline using 4-bit quantized IndicTrans2 and Whisper models stored directly in local device cache. Zero internet required.\n            </p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"solution-card\">\n          <div class=\"solution-icon-box\">🖼️</div>\n          <div class=\"solution-card-body\">\n            <h3 data-i18n=\"sol_card3_title\">Multimodal Visual Flashcards</h3>\n            <p data-i18n=\"sol_card3_desc\">\n              Converts spoken vocabulary into culturally relevant visual aids, pictograms, and dual-script flashcards to reinforce conceptual learning.\n            </p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"solution-card\">\n          <div class=\"solution-icon-box\">📊</div>\n          <div class=\"solution-card-body\">\n            <h3 data-i18n=\"sol_card4_title\">Low-Literacy Teacher Dashboard</h3>\n            <p data-i18n=\"sol_card4_desc\">\n              Minimalist, icon-driven interface designed for first-time smartphone users. Adapts JCERT textbook chapters into bilingual lessons with one tap.\n            </p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- =========================================================================\n       LIVE INTERACTIVE DEMO (Core Hackathon Showcase)\n       ========================================================================= -->\n  <section id=\"demo\" class=\"demo-section\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"text-center\">\n        <span class=\"section-tag\" data-i18n=\"demo_tag\">Interactive Working Prototype</span>\n        <h2 class=\"section-title\" data-i18n=\"demo_title\">Experience BhashaSetu In Action</h2>\n        <p class=\"section-subtitle\" data-i18n=\"demo_subtitle\">\n          Simulate a live rural classroom interaction. Select languages, load classroom scenarios, or speak into the microphone.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"demo-container\">\n        <!-- Top Control Bar -->\n        <div class=\"demo-top-bar\">\n          <div class=\"demo-title-group\">\n            <span class=\"demo-chip\">SIH Live Demo Engine</span>\n            <span style=\"font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.95rem;\">Rural Vernacular Bridge</span>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Online vs Offline Switch -->\n          <div class=\"demo-mode-switcher\">\n            <span style=\"font-size: 0.8rem; color: #94A3B8;\">Edge Mode (Offline)</span>\n            <label class=\"switch\" title=\"Toggle between Offline Edge Model and Cloud API\">\n              <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"modeToggle\">\n              <span class=\"slider\"></span>\n            </label>\n            <span style=\"font-size: 0.8rem; color: #CBD5E1;\">Cloud API</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Notification Banner showing current mode -->\n        <div id=\"modeBanner\" class=\"demo-mode-banner offline\">\n          <span id=\"modeStatusText\" data-i18n=\"demo_mode_badge_offline\">\n            ⚡ Offline Mode: 4-bit Quantized On-Device TFLite Model • 0 kbps internet • 310ms latency\n          </span>\n          <div class=\"bandwidth-badge\">📶 Bandwidth: 0 kbps</div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Presets Bar -->\n        <div class=\"demo-presets-row\">\n          <div class=\"preset-heading\">\n            <span>✨</span>\n            <span data-i18n=\"demo_preset_title\">Or Click a Common Classroom Scenario:</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"preset-buttons-container\">\n            <button class=\"preset-btn active\" data-preset=\"0\">\n              <span>🌅</span> <span data-i18n=\"demo_preset_1\">Morning Greeting & Roll Call</span>\n            </button>\n            <button class=\"preset-btn\" data-preset=\"1\">\n              <span>🔢</span> <span data-i18n=\"demo_preset_2\">Math Addition Lesson</span>\n            </button>\n            <button class=\"preset-btn\" data-preset=\"2\">\n              <span>🧼</span> <span data-i18n=\"demo_preset_3\">Hygiene & Mid-Day Meal</span>\n            </button>\n            <button class=\"preset-btn\" data-preset=\"3\">\n              <span>📖</span> <span data-i18n=\"demo_preset_4\">Folk Story Introduction</span>\n            </button>\n            <button class=\"preset-btn\" data-preset=\"4\">\n              <span>🌧️</span> <span data-i18n=\"demo_preset_5\">Science & Nature Observation</span>\n            </button>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Main Translation Workspace (Input | Output) -->\n        <div class=\"demo-workspace\">\n          <!-- Input Panel (Teacher) -->\n          <div class=\"demo-input-panel\">\n            <div class=\"panel-header\">\n              <span class=\"panel-label\" data-i18n=\"demo_src_lbl\">Teacher's Language (Input):</span>\n              <select id=\"srcLangSelect\" class=\"lang-select\">\n                <option value=\"hindi\" selected>Hindi (हिंदी)</option>\n                <option value=\"english\">English</option>\n                <option value=\"bengali\">Bengali (বাংলা)</option>\n                <option value=\"odia\">Odia (ଓଡ଼ିଆ)</option>\n                <option value=\"tamil\">Tamil (தமிழ்)</option>\n                <option value=\"telugu\">Telugu (తెలుగు)</option>\n              </select>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"input-field-wrapper\">\n              <textarea id=\"demoInput\" class=\"demo-textarea\" data-i18n-ph=\"demo_input_ph\" placeholder=\"Type teacher's instruction here, or click a classroom scenario preset below...\"></textarea>\n              \n              <div class=\"mic-action-bar\">\n                <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px;\">\n                  <button id=\"micBtn\" class=\"mic-btn\" title=\"Click to use microphone or simulated speech input\">\n                    🎤 <span>Voice Input</span>\n                  </button>\n                  <div id=\"soundwaveBox\" class=\"soundwave-box\">\n                    <div class=\"wave-bar\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"wave-bar\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"wave-bar\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"wave-bar\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"wave-bar\"></div>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n                <span id=\"charCounter\" class=\"char-counter\">0 / 500 characters</span>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <button id=\"translateBtn\" class=\"btn-translate\">\n              <span>✨</span>\n              <span data-i18n=\"demo_btn_translate\">Translate to Mother Tongue</span>\n            </button>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Output Panel (Student & Pedagogy Output) -->\n          <div class=\"demo-output-panel\" style=\"position: relative;\">\n            <!-- Loading Pipeline Overlay -->\n            <div id=\"pipelineOverlay\" class=\"pipeline-overlay\">\n              <div class=\"pipeline-spinner\"></div>\n              <div id=\"pipelineStepText\" class=\"pipeline-step-text\" data-i18n=\"demo_btn_translating\">\n                Processing AI Pedagogy Pipeline...\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"panel-header\">\n              <span class=\"panel-label\" data-i18n=\"demo_tgt_lbl\">Student's Mother Tongue (Output):</span>\n              <select id=\"tgtLangSelect\" class=\"lang-select\">\n                <option value=\"santhali\" selected>Santhali (ᱥᱟᱱᱛᱟᱲᱤ / Ol Chiki)</option>\n                <option value=\"mundari\">Mundari (मुंडारी / Mundari)</option>\n                <option value=\"ho\">Ho (ᱦᱳ / Warang Chiti)</option>\n                <option value=\"kurukh\">Kurukh (कुड़ुख़ / Oraon)</option>\n                <option value=\"kharia\">Kharia (खड़िया)</option>\n                <option value=\"hindi\">Hindi (हिंदी)</option>\n                <option value=\"bengali\">Bengali (বাংলা)</option>\n                <option value=\"odia\">Odia (ଓଡ଼ିଆ)</option>\n                <option value=\"english\">English</option>\n                <option value=\"tamil\">Tamil (தமிழ்)</option>\n                <option value=\"telugu\">Telugu (తెలుగు)</option>\n              </select>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"output-card\">\n              <div class=\"translated-result-box\">\n                <span id=\"scriptBadge\" class=\"script-badge\">Ol Chiki & Devanagari</span>\n                <div id=\"outputNativeText\" class=\"output-native-text\">\n                  ᱡᱚᱛᱚ ᱠᱚᱜᱮ ᱥᱟᱹᱜᱩᱱ ᱥᱮᱛᱟᱜ! ᱫᱟᱭᱟᱠᱟᱛᱮ ᱛᱷᱤᱨ ᱠᱟᱛᱮ ᱫᱩᱲᱩᱵᱽ ᱯᱮ ᱟᱨ ᱟᱯᱱᱟᱨᱟᱜ ᱯᱩᱛᱷᱤ ᱡᱷᱤᱡᱽ ᱯᱮ।\n                </div>\n                <div id=\"outputDevanagariAlt\" class=\"output-devanagari-alt\">\n                  देवनागरी लिपि: जोतो कोगे सगुन सेताः! दायाकाते थीर काते दुड़ुब पे आर आपनाराः पुथी झिज पे।\n                </div>\n              </div>\n\n              <!-- Teacher's Pronunciation Guide -->\n              <div class=\"phonetic-guide-box\">\n                <div class=\"phonetic-label\" data-i18n=\"demo_phonetic_title\">Teacher's Pronunciation Guide (How to speak it):</div>\n                <div id=\"phoneticText\" class=\"phonetic-text\">\n                  \"Joto koge sagun setag! Dayakate thir kate durub pe aar apnarag puthi jhij pe.\"\n                </div>\n              </div>\n\n              <!-- Contextual Visual Flashcard -->\n              <div class=\"visual-flashcard\">\n                <div id=\"flashcardEmoji\" class=\"flashcard-emoji\">📚🎒</div>\n                <div class=\"flashcard-info\">\n                  <div id=\"flashcardTag\" class=\"flashcard-tag\">Classroom Concept: GREETING</div>\n                  <div id=\"flashcardTitle\" class=\"flashcard-title\">Classroom Morning / किताबें और कक्षा</div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n\n              <!-- Action Bar (Play Audio, Copy Text) -->\n              <div class=\"output-action-bar\">\n                <button id=\"playAudioBtn\" class=\"btn-audio\">\n                  <span>🔊</span> <span data-i18n=\"demo_listen_btn\">Play Audio</span>\n                </button>\n                <button id=\"copyTextBtn\" class=\"btn-copy\">\n                  <span>📋</span> <span data-i18n=\"demo_copy_btn\">Copy Text</span>\n                </button>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n'@ | Out-File -FilePath \"index.html\" -Append -Encoding utf8","Cwd":"C:\\Users\\Lenovo\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\bhashasetu-ai","IsDaemon":false,"WaitMsBeforeAsync":3000,"toolAction":"Write Part 2 of index.html","toolSummary":"Write Problem, Solution, and D